cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, cite this repository and the STaRK benchmark."
type: software
title: "SlotSpace: Ambiguity-aware, fact-level retrieval with a shared slot space"
authors:
  - name: "SlotSpace contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/sunbohit/SlotSpace"
url: "https://github.com/sunbohit/SlotSpace"
version: 0.1.0
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  Research software for schema-shared, fact-bound retrieval and
  ambiguity-aware query planning. Version 0.1.0 is an unreleased code
  candidate; full neural experiments and real-engine acceptance are pending.
